(CAROUSEL & LONG-FORM POST FRAMEWORK PACK) Tj
0 -40 Td
/F1 12 Tf
(ToolForgeHQ - 15 Frameworks for Educational Carousels & Long Posts) Tj
0 -30 Td
(=================================================) Tj
0 -25 Td
(FRAMEWORK 1: THE HOW-TO CAROUSEL (10 slides)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 1: Hook headline - "How to [achieve result] in [timeframe]") Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 2: The problem/pain point your audience faces) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slides 3-8: Step-by-step instructions (one step per slide)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 9: Summary of all steps) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 10: CTA - Save, share, follow for more) Tj
0 -30 Td
(FRAMEWORK 2: THE LISTICLE CAROUSEL (7 slides)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 1: "X [things/tips/mistakes] about [topic]") Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slides 2-6: One item per slide with brief explanation) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 7: Recap + CTA) Tj
0 -30 Td
(FRAMEWORK 3: THE MYTH BUSTER (6 slides)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 1: "Stop believing these [topic] myths") Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slides 2-5: Myth vs Reality (one per slide)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 6: "Now you know the truth" + CTA) Tj
0 -30 Td
(FRAMEWORK 4: THE MINI-GUIDE (8 slides)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 1: "The complete guide to [topic]") Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 2: What is [topic] and why it matters) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slides 3-6: Key concepts/sections) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 7: Common mistakes to avoid) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 8: Next steps + CTA) Tj
0 -30 Td
(FRAMEWORK 5: THE BEFORE/AFTER (5 slides)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 1: Transformation hook) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 2: The "before" state) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 3: What changed) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 4: The "after" state) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 5: How you can do it too + CTA) Tj
0 -30 Td
(FRAMEWORK 6: THE COMPARISON (6 slides)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 1: "[Option A] vs [Option B]: Which is better?") Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slides 2-5: Compare different aspects) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Slide 6: Verdict + when to use each + CTA) Tj
0 -30 Td
(LONG-FORM POST FRAMEWORK: THE VALUE BOMB) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Line 1: Hook that stops the scroll) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Line 2-3: Expand on the hook, create curiosity) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Body: Deliver massive value (tips, steps, insights)) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Transition: Personal story or example) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Close: Summary + clear CTA) Tj
0 -30 Td
(DESIGN TIPS FOR CAROUSELS:) Tj
0 -18 Td
(- Use consistent fonts and colors across all slides) Tj
0 -18 Td
(- Keep text minimal - one main point per slide) Tj
0 -18 Td
(- Use visual hierarchy: headline > subhead > body) Tj
0 -18 Td
(- Include your branding on first and last slides) Tj
